{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Plan-review remediation: corrected the false premise that External Integration already had macOS. It is currently Ubuntu-only; the ADR now explicitly assigns the later implementation ticket to add a dedicated ubuntu-latest + macos-latest Pandoc replay matrix. Split compound acceptance criteria and tagged the external Gerrit HOLD/merge outcomes operator-attested with their concrete evidence."},"env_id":"0993f6a8-7a6a-4707-a671-c5bbb2691444","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786716789451512001,"uuid":"dfe18952-6302-4d9f-b0ab-79b929ca3aef"}